<!--
  Deliberate resource override.

  @jofr/capacitor-media-session ships this name as a "skip previous" (⏮) glyph and
  uses it for the previoustrack notification action. In Cassette the wheel/notification
  PREVIOUS button is remapped to ♥ favorite, so the icon is replaced with a heart to
  match what the button actually does. App-module resources win over library resources
  during merge, so this file shadows the plugin's without patching node_modules.

  Material Symbols "favorite" (filled), 24dp.
-->
